    <briefdescription>
<para>Marks an entity as an enemy. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is a tag component used by the <ref refid="classEnemySystem" kindref="compound">EnemySystem</ref> to identify and process enemy entities. It contains a flag to enable/disable the enemy without destroying the entity.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This component is used in conjunction with <ref refid="structComponents_1_1Transform" kindref="compound">Transform</ref>, <ref refid="structComponents_1_1Patrol" kindref="compound">Patrol</ref>, and <ref refid="structComponents_1_1PhysicsBody" kindref="compound">PhysicsBody</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
